exports[`renderPage > matches the overview snapshot 1`] = `"<section class="view" id="/overview" data-view="overview" aria-labelledby="h-overview"><h1 id="h-overview" tabindex="-1">Overview</h1><div class="live" data-live="view-overview" data-v=""><p class="lede">What this gateway sent, what came back and what waits for you, read from its local log.</p><div class="kpis"><div class="card"><p class="k">Approved today</p><p class="v">$41.98</p><div class="bar-track" aria-hidden="true"><div class="bar-fill w55"></div></div><p class="small">of $75.00 daily limit (your policy, last 24 h)</p></div><div class="card card-hot"><p class="k">Waiting for you</p><p class="v">1</p><p class="small">Running shoes · $18.00 · open approval page</p><a class="small" href="#/approvals">See approvals</a></div><div class="card"><p class="k">Sent to Intent Cloud</p><p class="v">6</p><p class="small">6 acknowledged by receipt</p><p class="small t-warn">1 logged, maybe sent</p></div><div class="card"><p class="k">Refused before sending</p><p class="v t-bad">1</p><p class="small">last: excluded or blocked category, nothing sent</p></div></div><div class="split"><section class="panel feed-panel" aria-labelledby="h-activity"><h2 id="h-activity">Activity</h2><ol class="feed"><li><time datetime="2026-10-16T10:30:00.000Z">10:30</time><span class="label t-warn">search</span><span>Search · &#60;script&#62;alert(1)&#60;/script&#62; · maybe sent</span></li><li><time datetime="2026-10-16T10:29:00.000Z">10:29</time><span class="label t-plain">cart</span><span>Cart · 1 × offer of_sock · ZIP 94103 · $18.00 · receipt ✓ · approval asked</span></li><li><time datetime="2026-10-16T10:28:00.000Z">10:28</time><span class="label t-ok">approved</span><span>Approved · $41.98 · passkey f502…8c9f ✓ · pinned as your approver</span></li><li><time datetime="2026-10-16T10:28:00.000Z">10:28</time><span class="label t-plain">status</span><span>Approval status checked · ap_shoe · receipt ✓</span></li><li><time datetime="2026-10-16T10:27:00.000Z">10:27</time><span class="label t-plain">cart</span><span>Cart · 1 × offer of_8Kx2a…hij · ZIP 94103 · $41.98 · receipt ✓ · approval asked</span></li><li><time datetime="2026-10-16T10:26:00.000Z">10:26</time><span class="label t-bad">refused</span><span>Search refused before sending: excluded or blocked category · nothing sent</span></li><li><time datetime="2026-10-16T10:26:00.000Z">10:26</time><span class="label t-plain">search</span><span>Search · running shoes · under $120.00 · ZIP 94103 · receipt ✓</span></li><li><time datetime="2026-10-15T08:01:00.000Z">2026-10-15 08:01</time><span class="label t-ok">approved</span><span>Approved · $30.00</span></li><li><time datetime="2026-10-15T08:00:00.000Z">2026-10-15 08:00</time><span class="label t-plain">cart</span><span>Cart · $30.00 · approval asked</span></li></ol><a class="more" href="#/purchases">Purchases timeline</a></section><section class="panel rules" aria-labelledby="h-rules"><h2 id="h-rules">Your rules</h2><p>Shares: ZIP code only</p><p>Per order: up to $60</p><p>Per day: up to $75</p><p>Approver: passkey <code>f502…8c9f</code> (pinned)</p><p class="small">A policy can only narrow the rules Intent Cloud enforces.</p><a class="more" href="#/policy">Policy details</a></section></div><section class="panel logstrip" aria-labelledby="h-strip"><h2 id="h-strip">Server log</h2><ol class="strip"><li class="t-ok"><span>#18</span> <span>10:29:00</span> receipt for #17 · status 201 · signature checked</li><li class="t-plain"><span>#19</span> <span>10:29:00</span> approval asked ap_sock · $18.00</li><li class="t-plain"><span>#20</span> <span>10:30:00</span> logged searchCatalog  no body fields</li></ol><a class="more" href="#/log">Full server log</a></section></div></section><section class="view" id="/purchases""`;
